    "name": "Gunny Ascend",
    "steam_appid": 2886300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/05969cd5895f220e10d87ee01f5d0edc.avif?t=1755465057\" data-has-big width=800 height=128 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Roguelite Puzzle Game That Reinvents a Timeless Formula</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if falling blocks met a jump button and a rebellion?<br><strong>Gunny Ascend</strong> transforms the classic block-stacking puzzle formula into a fast-paced, genre-bending experience. Blending roguelite progression, adaptive platforming, and a dimension-hopping story full of chaos, charm, and surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/8bb1ee515543c81048aa01491f70adaf.mp4?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STACK. PLAN. FIGHT BACK.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocks fall. You adapt. And now, you fight.<br><br>Play as Gunny, a quiet but determined construction worker caught in a dimensional conflict. After being captured by <strong>The Collectors</strong>, interdimensional beings obsessed with preserving stories. He escapes with the help of his mentor Wako, steals a portal-controlling truck, making it their mission to free all those who the Collectors have captured and build a team to bring an end to them once and for all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/7c3f3d0a602c32ba5c9287aecd65ab11.avif?t=1755465057\" data-has-big width=800 height=363 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW KIND OF ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagine the falling-block formula with real-time movement, tactical platforming, and roguelite unpredictability. Each run brings new hazards, enemies, and item combinations\u2014challenging you to evolve your approach every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/f08691d66ca69d1e14e40c057bca68dc.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/f08691d66ca69d1e14e40c057bca68dc.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CELEBRATION OF INDIE SPIRIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, <strong>Gunny Ascend</strong> is a tribute to the creativity and surprise that define the indie gaming world.<br>Unlock unexpected characters, encounter homages to beloved indie titles, and experience a story that honors originality and the joy of discovery\u2014both in gameplay and in the heroes you meet along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/9359f74e638c1d9c03af2b1c671f7b26.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/9359f74e638c1d9c03af2b1c671f7b26.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roguelite story mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique characters and worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 bosses with uniquely distinct mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 items to unlock, combine and equip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP online multiplayer battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack &amp; Sound Design by Cactus Bear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/bf322579ec7cf0e13a9c18aa26364a54.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/bf322579ec7cf0e13a9c18aa26364a54.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
