tn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/7c3f3d0a602c32ba5c9287aecd65ab11.avif?t=1755465057\" data-has-big width=800 height=363 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A NEW KIND OF ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reimagine the falling-block formula with real-time movement, tactical platforming, and roguelite unpredictability. Each run brings new hazards, enemies, and item combinations\u2014challenging you to evolve your approach every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/f08691d66ca69d1e14e40c057bca68dc.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/f08691d66ca69d1e14e40c057bca68dc.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CELEBRATION OF INDIE SPIRIT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core, <strong>Gunny Ascend</strong> is a tribute to the creativity and surprise that define the indie gaming world.<br>Unlock unexpected characters, encounter homages to beloved indie titles, and experience a story that honors originality and the joy of discovery\u2014both in gameplay and in the heroes you meet along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/9359f74e638c1d9c03af2b1c671f7b26.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/9359f74e638c1d9c03af2b1c671f7b26.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Roguelite story mode.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ unique characters and worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 bosses with uniquely distinct mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 items to unlock, combine and equip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP online multiplayer battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller compatibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack &amp; Sound Design by Cactus Bear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/bf322579ec7cf0e13a9c18aa26364a54.poster.avif?t=1755465057\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886300/extras/bf322579ec7cf0e13a9c18aa26364a54.webm?t=1755465057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
